---
/**
 * 手写页（迁移自 en/terms/index.html，源码即产物 → Astro 源文件）。
 * 语言：en；标记注入区已改为 frontmatter 函数调用（同一数据源/同一公式）；
 * 联盟/广告占位注释原样保留，构建后由 placement 状态机重写。
 */
import Layout from '../../../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title={"Terms of Use | Reflex Hub"}
  desc={"Terms of use for Reflex Hub: the nature of the service, pricing and estimation disclaimers, third-party services and trademarks, intellectual property, limitation of liability and how terms change."}
  ogDescription={"Service nature, data limitations, third-party services and disclaimers."}
  canonicalPath="/en/terms/"
  jsonld={[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"AboutPage","name":"Terms of Use","url":"https://www.reflex-hub.com/en/terms/","inLanguage":"en","description":"Terms of use for Reflex Hub: service nature, data limitations, third-party services and disclaimers."},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.reflex-hub.com/en/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Terms of Use","item":"https://www.reflex-hub.com/en/terms/"}]}]}
  crumb={"/ Terms of Use"}>
  <Fragment slot="bodyend" set:html={"\n\n  <script>window.ASSETS_BASE = '../../assets';</script>\n  <script src=\"../../assets/app.js\"></script>"} />
<section class="hero">
      <h1>Terms of use</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Service nature · data limitations · third-party services · disclaimers</p>
    </section>

    <p class="lede">
      Using Reflex Hub means you understand and accept the terms below. This site is a free tool and public-information
      compilation; it provides no legal, procurement or investment advice. Last updated: 2026-10-28.
    </p>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>1. Nature of the service</h2>
      <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.9">
        · The site provides free tools such as LLM API cost estimation, model-spec lookup and comparison, offered "as is"
        with no guarantee of uninterrupted or error-free operation;<br>
        · Content is informational and computational assistance; it does not constitute legal advice, procurement advice,
        investment advice, or any evaluation of model quality.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>2. Prices, exchange rates and estimates</h2>
      <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.9">
        · Model prices come from vendors' public list prices with sources and verification dates; <strong>the vendors'
        official pages and consoles prevail</strong>; after a price change, this site's data may lag behind the official page;<br>
        · USD models are converted at a reference rate (the CFETS central parity rate); converted values are indicative
        only and constitute no exchange-rate commitment;<br>
        · Cost estimates rely on fixed assumptions and exclude free tiers, resource packs, subscription discounts and
        limited-time promotions; <strong>an estimate is not a provider's actual invoice</strong>. For production or
        commercial procurement, rely on the provider's formal quotes, contracts and terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>3. Third-party services and trademarks</h2>
      <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.9">
        · Names and trademarks such as DeepSeek, GLM, Kimi, Qwen, Hunyuan, MiniMax, MiMo, Step, GPT, Claude and Gemini
        belong to their respective vendors; this site is a third-party data compilation with no affiliation or endorsement;<br>
        · Links to vendor or third-party tool sites are governed by the destination's content, availability and privacy
        practices, which are not our responsibility;<br>
        · Pricing models and use cases in the tool directory carry verification dates and may lag behind product changes.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>4. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.9">
        · Original page structure, calculation-method write-ups and compilations belong to this site; factual data such as
        prices and specs come from vendors' public information;<br>
        · Please credit this site when quoting its content; you must not imply in any way that this site is an official
        vendor channel.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>5. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.9">
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, this site is not liable for any direct, indirect or incidental loss
        arising from use or inability to use its content. You assess and bear the risk of any decision made with this
        site's data.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>6. Changes and feedback</h2>
      <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.9">
        Terms may be updated as site features evolve; the date above marks the current version. Questions and suggestions
        are welcome via <a href="https://github.com/cheneychen2000/ai-station-tools/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Issues</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
</Layout>
